 "remarks": "Perfect for the holidays! Set on more than three acres in the heart of North Stamford, this mid-century modern home offers privacy, generous living spaces, and endless opportunity for buyers ready to implement their vision and unlock this property's full potential. Featuring 4-5 bedrooms, three full baths, and one half bath, the flexible floor plan accommodates everyday living, entertaining, and working from home. Abundant windows and skylights fill the home with natural light, highlighting brand-new hardwood floors. A gracious entry foyer connects the living room, dining room, kitchen, and spacious family room with a fireplace and wet bar. Outdoor terraces and decks extend the entertaining space, complemented by beautiful gardens and a fire pit. The finished lower level features a second family room with another fireplace and wet bar, a versatile bedroom or exercise room, a sauna, a full bath, a laundry room and potential for an in-law arrangement. An attached garage and oversized driveway provide an abundance of parking for both traditional and oversized vehicles. Additional features include central air and an energy-efficient hybrid water heater. Whether you enjoy entertaining, need a dedicated workspace, or seek a peaceful sanctuary, this distinctive North Stamford retreat offers exceptional flexibility, room for personal touches, and the opportunity to add value. Property being sold as-is.",
